<title>USA: Dura Automotive completes VOFA Group buy.</title>
<headline>Dura Automotive completes VOFA Group buy.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dura Automotive Systems Inc said Friday it completed the previously announced acquisition of VOFA Group, a manufacturer based in Dusseldorf, Germany, with annual revenues of about $85 million.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>VOFA's products include shifter cables, brake cables and other light duty cables for the automotive and industrial markets.</p>
<p>Dura manufactures control mechanisms and cable-related systems for the automotive industry.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
